# The census officer's class quiz, the branch morrowind_main skips: "Answer his
# questions" (button 0 of EnableClassMenu's choice), ten questions from
# Morrowind.ini (each its first shown answer; the order is rolled per
# question), then "Accept this Class" (button 0) on the class they point to.
# The birthsign and the stat review follow as in morrowind_main.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --load mwtest_chargen_race --fast --stop-on-fail --timeout 1800
# See docs/commentary/morrowind_runtime.md#class-choice

case quiz_class
activate "chargen customs door"
until 600 GetPCCell "Seyda Neen, Census and Excise Office" == 1
run
player->PositionCell 160 -111 220 90 "Seyda Neen, Census and Excise Office"
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
button 0
pick The Warrior
button 0
button 0
button 0
until 300 "chargen class".state == -1
end
